drumee-bootstrap (2.0.6) stable; urgency=medium

  * entrypoint/app: drop --no-daemon from the pm2-runtime invocation. pm2-runtime IS
    the no-daemon entry point and rejects the flag with
    `error: unknown option '--no-daemon'`, so the app role crash-looped before ever
    reaching the application.

